---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Writing"
description: "Shorter, more opinionated pieces on governance, group facilitation, and infrastructure — as we actually try them."
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<div class="section wrap">
  <div class="section-head">
    <h1>Writing</h1>
  </div>
  <p class="lede">
    Notes, arguments, and updates — subscribe via the <a href="/feed.xml">Atom feed</a> if you'd rather not check back manually.
  </p>

  <ul class="entry-list">
    {% for item in collections.articles %}
    <li class="entry">
      <h2 class="entry-title"><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a></h2>
      <p class="entry-meta">
        <time datetime="{{ item.date | dateISO }}">{{ item.date | dateReadable }}</time>
        {% for tag in item.data.tags %}{% if tag != "articles" %}<span class="tag">{{ tag }}</span>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      </p>
      {% if item.data.summary %}<p class="entry-summary">{{ item.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>
